==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*30 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since all the enemies spawn on a timer, you can rush the stage to easily skip most of it. Bring a reliable quick critter such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat) | Catornado]] to get past the initial [[Metal Hippoe | Metal Hippoes]], and bring units with high dps such as [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to tear through the base quickly.

